"How big menus and the HUD are.","Makes the game fill your whole screen.","Matches the frame rate to your screen\'s refresh rate. Removes tearing.","Varies","The highest frame rate the game aims for. A lower limit keeps your device cooler.","Moves your view up and down slightly while walking.","Shows how charged your attack is, next to the crosshair or the hotbar.","Shows your frame rate on the HUD.","Shows your coordinates on the HUD.","Shows the special FNAW player skins.","Quality","Fancy draws see-through leaves and nicer weather. Fast is quicker.",
"Medium","How clouds are drawn, or turn them off.","Low","How many particles are shown.","Smooth lighting: soft shadows in corners and under blocks.","Shows round shadows under mobs and items.","Fades out terrain at the edge of your render distance.","Smooths textures that are far away. Lower can be faster on weak graphics chips.","Uses custom item textures from resource packs (OptiFine format).","Red and cyan 3D, for 3D glasses.","Performance modpack","All of the ported performance mods below. Turn it off to play like vanilla (handy if something looks broken). Their own settings stay saved. Also in Treasure Settings → Performance.",
"Draws chests and beds as part of the world instead of one by one, which is much faster.","Draws the HUD with far fewer draw calls, plus cheaper name labels and sign text.","Particle Culling","Skips particles behind you or off screen.","Cheaper particle movement, fewer leftover particles, and particles land on the ground properly.","Faster sine and cosine math, the same numbers as OptiFine\'s Fast Math.","Faster collisions, chunk lookups and block entity lists. Same results as vanilla.","Smoother chunk loading: big bursts from the server are handled over a few ticks instead of freezing the game.",
"Drops to 10 FPS while another window is focused, so your device stays cool.","Stops the idle singleplayer worker while you\'re on a server.","Recovers from crashes instead of closing the game, plus Minecraft bug fixes.","How many chunks are rebuilt per frame. Lower is smoother, higher loads changes faster.","Fixes chunks that sometimes don\'t show up.","Lets you turn off animations, particles, sky parts and some entities below for extra FPS. When off, everything is drawn like vanilla.","All Animations","Every animated texture. Off freezes them all.",
